amespace":"bangumi.character","value":"74133"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"重装兵","original":"マーダルの城を警護する白兵戦用の機甲兵。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"重装兵","original":"マーダルの城を警護する白兵戦用の機甲兵。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764","status":"source_backed"}],"aliases":[{"text":"重装兵","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764","status":"source_backed"}],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"alias","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:762764"}]},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"10"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Heavy","original":"就像一只正在冬眠的熊，重装兵看起来是个温和的大家伙。当然他的外表也像只熊，他总是会很迷煳，昏昏欲睡、或做出温柔的动作，但请注意，尽管他举止温柔，但他轻而易举便能将你大卸八块。他尽量节省自己的体力，但他却还是很爱睡觉。重装兵不是笨蛋，他也不是你的大朋友，他通常会希望你在他得亲自动手前自己赶快闭上嘴。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Heavy","original":"就像一只正在冬眠的熊，重装兵看起来是个温和的大家伙。当然他的外表也像只熊，他总是会很迷煳，昏昏欲睡、或做出温柔的动作，但请注意，尽管他举止温柔，但他轻而易举便能将你大卸八块。他尽量节省自己的体力，但他却还是很爱睡觉。重装兵不是笨蛋，他也不是你的大朋友，他通常会希望你在他得亲自动手前自己赶快闭上嘴。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078"}],"score":-24.683675643494084},{"entry_key":{"kind":"subject","namespace":"bangumi.subject","value":"140528"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Heavy Weapon","original":"《重装兵器》（Heavy Weapon）是Popcap在2005年发行的一个横向卷轴清版射击游戏。\r\n\r\n游戏《重装兵器》中，玩家操控一台威力强大的原能坦克与敌人对抗。主要武器有攻击范围180度的机枪，还有能清空屏幕上的敌人的核子武器。在游戏的主线剧情里，玩家扮演坦克的指挥官抵抗红军（苏联）的入侵，且必须打败头目以通关。\r\n\r\n游戏中一共有19个级别/任务和两个游戏模式（任务模式和生存模式）。\r\n\r\n任务模式里的每个任务里玩家有三条生命，玩家要攻击大量的敌军并摧毁敌军头目以达成任务目标 完成任务后可以到兵工厂升级与替换武器。击败前九个头目后，玩家需再击败同样的九个新头目，不过新头目的武器与装备与之前的有些微不同。\r\n\r\n电脑版的《重装兵器》中，生存模式只给玩家一条命，并且玩到坦克被摧毁为止。Xbox 360 与 PS3 的版本中，玩家能选择独自或与其他最多四人进行游戏。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:133703","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Heavy Weapon","original":"《重装兵器》（Heavy Weapon）是Popcap在2005年发行的一个横向卷轴清版射击游戏。\r\n\r\n游戏《重装兵器》中，玩家操控一台威力强大的原能坦克与敌人对抗。主要武器有攻击范围180度的机枪，还有能清空屏幕上的敌人的核子武器。在游戏的主线剧情里，玩家扮演坦克的指挥官抵抗红军（苏联）的入侵，且必须打败头目以通关。\r\n\r\n游戏中一共有19个级别/任务和两个游戏模式（任务模式和生存模式）。\r\n\r\n任务模式里的每个任务里玩家有三条生命，玩家要攻击大量的敌军并摧毁敌军头目以达成任务目标 完成任务后可以到兵工厂升级与替换武器。击败前九个头目后，玩家需再击败同样的九个新头目，不过新头目的武器与装备与之前的有些微不同。\r\n\r\n电脑版的《重装兵器》中，生存模式只给玩家一条命，并且玩到坦克被摧毁为止。Xbox 360 与 PS3 的版本中，玩家能选择独自或与其他最多四人进行游戏。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:133703"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:133703","status":"source_backed","type":"subject","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:133703","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:133703"}],"score":-22.474793024504862},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"112681"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"ユゴ・ロブレス","original":"銀装兵団の元剣士長。ドナピエルーに家族がいる。銀装兵団の国外逃亡計画には参加せず、レーゼに残る選択をとる。その際の後任としてシンを指名した。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1